{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"57815","self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/57815","key":"SV-11322","fields":{"summary":"Switcher tooltip covers the column header row","description":"h3. What\n\nOpen the switcher's hover tooltip above the switcher.\n\nThe tooltip words *List*, *Tech View* and *Board View* are right (S1-R9b, Chris Ward answer 24) and are not part of this ticket; only where the tooltip opens is wrong.\n\nh3. Expected\n\nS1-R9b (v58): \"The switcher’s hover tooltip opens above the switcher, so it never covers the table’s column header row. The tooltips read List, Tech View and Board View.\"\n\nPRD: [Board View & Tech View PRD v58|https://shopview.atlassian.net/wiki/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=845185030] (page 845185030, version 58, read 16 Oct 2026) (S1-R9b).\n\nh3. Actual (staging build, develop b19269d4487, clicked through locally)\n\nHovering Tech View in the switcher shows the \"Tech View\" tooltip below it, on top of the Service Advisor header.\n\n* Still the same on staging {{v26.40.18-7d85b7d}}, 16 Oct 2026: every switcher tooltip opens below the switcher, over the column header row, in Tech View and Board View, at 1440 and 1536 px wide (test C590111).\n\nh3. How to check\n\n* Hover each of the three switcher buttons: the tooltip shows above the switcher and the header row stays readable.\n\nh3. Screenshots\n\nAttached: staging build first, Branko's design (files starting D) after.\n\nRaised from Sasha's staging review, 2026-10-14.\n\n----\n\n*Test case for this design issue:*\n\n* [C590111|https://shopview.testrail.io/index.php?/cases/view/590111] Display switcher tooltips open above it and never cover the column headers","comment":{"comments":[{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/57815/comment/78735","id":"78735","author":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/user?accountId=712020%3Aaa00b8d6-a71f-4259-8919-82a304227c20","ac